  "name": "Piston-Tutorials",
  "description": "A structured repository of educational resources and example implementations for the Piston game engine ecosystem in Rust. It provides modular tutorials covering windowing abstractions, OpenGL backends, and event loop management using SDL2 and custom graphics pipelines. The project includes a dedicated Markdown compiler utility for managing tutorial documentation and relative asset path resolution.",
